-- ============================================================================
§ `Section 9: A temporary licence for a foreign expert`
-- ============================================================================

--  foreign state, kilowatts invited for, authorised abroad, application date, latest similar work, recognised
`an expert who meets every condition` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 120, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2024 6 1), TRUE
`an expert invited to work on exactly 70 kilowatts` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 70, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2024 6 1), TRUE
`an expert whose last similar work was exactly six years before the application` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 120, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2020 1 10), TRUE
`an expert whose last similar work was a day more than six years before the application` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 120, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2020 1 9), TRUE
`an expert with no similar work on record` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 120, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, NOTHING, TRUE
`an expert the Registrar has not recognised` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 120, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2024 6 1), FALSE
`an applicant who is not from a foreign state` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF FALSE, 120, TRUE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2024 6 1), TRUE
`an expert not authorised abroad` MEANS
    `Foreign expert` OF TRUE, 120, FALSE, YMD 2026 1 10, JUST (YMD 2024 6 1), TRUE

#ASSERT `s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` `an expert who meets every condition`
-- (1): "מעל 70" -- above 70, so exactly 70 is not enough.
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a)(1): invited to work on a system of cooling output above 70 kilowatts` `an expert invited to work on exactly 70 kilowatts`
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` `an expert invited to work on exactly 70 kilowatts`
-- (2): the six years before the application (F-T5: exactly six years counts).
#ASSERT `s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and did similar work in the six years before the application` `an expert whose last similar work was exactly six years before the application`
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and did similar work in the six years before the application` `an expert whose last similar work was a day more than six years before the application`
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and did similar work in the six years before the application` `an expert with no similar work on record`
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a)(2): authorised abroad, and did similar work in the six years before the application` `an expert not authorised abroad`
-- (3): the Registrar's recognition is a determination, recorded.
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` `an expert the Registrar has not recognised`
-- "ממדינת חוץ": from a foreign state.
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` `an applicant who is not from a foreign state`
-- Section 9(a) as enacted has NO exam condition: an expert qualifies with no certificate and no
-- exam anywhere in the record.  The SimpLEX worked example's "section 9(a): requires passing an
-- exam" is therefore not this section (see NOTES.md, fork F-T4).
#ASSERT `s 9(a): the conditions for a temporary licence are met by` `an expert who meets every condition`

-- The period: not more than one year; renewals: two further, no more.
#ASSERT `s 9: a period from` (YMD 2026 1 10) `to` (YMD 2027 1 10) `does not exceed one year`
#ASSERT NOT `s 9: a period from` (YMD 2026 1 10) `to` (YMD 2027 1 11) `does not exceed one year`
#ASSERT `s 9(b): a further renewal is open given these renewals already given:` 0
#ASSERT `s 9(b): a further renewal is open given these renewals already given:` 1
#ASSERT NOT `s 9(b): a further renewal is open given these renewals already given:` 2
#ASSERT `the latest last day of a temporary licence that began on` (YMD 2026 1 10) EQUALS YMD 2029 1 10

#TRACE `s 9(a): the Registrar may give a temporary Grade 3 licence to` `an expert who meets every condition` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Registrar` DOES `give a temporary Grade 3 licence to the foreign expert` AT 20
#TRACE `s 9(a): the Registrar may give a temporary Grade 3 licence to` `an expert who meets every condition` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 500)

